NARRATIVE schema:
Add these fields when grounded in sourceEvidence:
- chapter
- scene
- character
- characterRole
- event
- eventType
- motivation
- conflict
- cause
- effect
- location
- timeReference
- quote

Generate one IdeaBlock per event, character action, dialogue turn, motivation, cause, or consequence.
The criticalQuestion may be English or Korean, but it must be specific to the source event.
Do not invent character motivation when the source only implies it weakly.
